    "completed_datetime": "05/04/2022 12:00 AM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 05/05/22  5:03:43 AM: There are pins that hold the arm in placing and allow it to swivel. The right side pin had worked it's way towards the arm and was scraping everytime the arm moved up and down. I adjusted the pin and tightened the set screw bolt and jam nut. Had to turn the air pressure down quite a bit. The arm was pretty \"jumpy\" from too much air pressure. Tested machine and had operator run a part. All is good.",
