    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 07/25/23 11:58:10 AM: Matt got the tips and tip holder cleaned and the welder is running good now. | Preston Ellexson - 07/25/23  7:39:15 AM: Checked voltage on the arms while cycling machine with weld on. Getting current through the top and bottom arm. When you get the the tips there is nothing. I suggested to Matt to remove top and bottom tip. Clean, buff, or polish and try again. If not that, he is going to clean the tip holders. If that still doesn't work, I told him to holler back at us to help further.",
