    "comments": "Joshua Patton - 07/10/24  8:31:02 AM: the A side pump was sitting out for about two weeks before they were able to get a new barrel, when the started running the machine would through a A side barrel empty code, I Spoke With Ronnie from sealed air and he told me to check the screen on the bottom of the pump that it was probably clogged and the issue, removed the screen it was clogged I have Ronnie sending 4 New screens over night, I was able to get some of the clogged screen clean but not all they are running at the moment I will change out the screen with a new one when it arrives.",
