    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 09/02/26  8:06:00 AM: I got this completed last week. Locked machine out. Scraped off all mold debris from hoses/lines, and dispenser assembly. Got the A/B lines removed from the dispenser assembly and plugged. Removed the assembly and replaced with new. I left the existing power cable for the assembly and reconnected the wiring inside. Got everything hooked up, lines back on, and tightened everything. Unlocked machine and turned on the cycle the home position of the dispenser assembly. Installed a new mixing block. Had Derek run some molds to test. Machine is running great with no issues. I'm sending Randy an email to order another mixing block. | Preston Ellexson - 08/25/26  7:27:16 AM: Going to get this looked at before the day is out.",
